5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Let's start by being honest. We need a logical way to find the werewolf. I suggest we watch for any sudden changes in how people speak.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,That sounds like a plan! But what if the werewolf is just really good at acting? This is like a big mystery game!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,Efficiency is key. We should decide when the Seer will reveal their information to avoid wasting time or risking a premature attack.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with a calm approach. Let's observe each other quietly first. I prefer to follow the most reasonable argument.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you guys! I'll help find the bad guy. We just have to trust our friends, right?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Trust is fine, Kenji, but we need evidence. If someone claims to be the Seer too early, it might be a bluff to confuse us.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Or maybe the real Seer is just excited! Why wait? The sooner we know, the better, don't you think?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"If the Seer reveals too early, the werewolf will simply kill them next. Timing is a strategic necessity.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Toshio makes a valid point. Stability is better than haste. I'll watch for inconsistencies in the claims.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I don't like the idea of hiding things. If someone knows something, they should just say it!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"It's not about hiding, Kenji, it's about survival. I'll be analyzing everyone's emotional reactions to see who is nervous.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, I'm not nervous at all! But maybe someone else is shaking in their boots right now!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,Emotional analysis is subjective. I will rely on the divination results and the logic of the voting patterns.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will support the most composed voice. Let's see how the first night's information changes the mood.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm just being honest! I can't believe we're already acting like we don't trust each other.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
